  m_Name: J1_Seq1_02
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ChoiceSO
  showScore: 1
  Id: 69dcbbf4-aad5-4a5a-95da-24f8e379a340
  choiceText: What do you choose to do?
  options:
  - id: c090e7d5-646d-4ba7-a82a-03156155c406
    text: 'You put one member of staff on the project to put together a rough price.
      The staff member is stretched and unable to fully review all the drawings.
      There is a risk they have missed pricing some parts of the design, but it is
      just a budget right?

'
    profit: 0
    profitStatus: 2
    satisfaction: -20
    satisfactionStatus: 0
    nextSequence: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bca0be70566d8514dac97947db7da228, type: 2}
  - id: cd3715fb-1184-419a-bcbb-bf35e2262c69
    text: You put a small team on the project who reviews the information and puts
      together a very thorough tender. One member of the team is overly cautious
      and suggests they allow for anything they can possibly think of that might
      be required, regardless of whether it is on the drawings and scope information.
      The project is significantly over budget.
    profit: 0
    profitStatus: 2
    satisfaction: -10
    satisfactionStatus: 0
    nextSequence: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 66ff626aa50d64742a3b672a79df4de4, type: 2}
  - id: bfaf2724-de6b-4fb4-82b3-79269abd2e15
    text: You put a small team on the projects with adequate checks and balances.
      They put together a thorough exclusion and clarification list to identify what
      is or is not included in the budget.
    profit: 0
    profitStatus: 1
    satisfaction: -5
    satisfactionStatus: 0
    nextSequence: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1fd88d464c8e27c498e9e861e7af5b2d, type: 2}
